+Environment Variables
+
+For local development set these in umaisense-back-main/.env. The full production template (Yandex Cloud KZ) is umaisense-back-main/.env.example; in production the server refuses to start if any setting points outside Kazakhstan.
+
+env
+PORT=5000
+NODE_ENV=development
+
+MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/umai_sense
+
+JWT_SECRET=your_super_secret_key_here
+
+CLIENT_URL=http://localhost:5173
+
+# SMTP (email OTP) — in production only a provider in Kazakhstan
+SMTP_HOST=smtp.example.kz
+SMTP_PORT=587
+SMTP_USER=your@email.com
+SMTP_PASS=your_smtp_password
+
+# Object Storage (optional locally; required in production)
+S3_ENDPOINT=https://storage.yandexcloud.kz
+S3_REGION=kz1
+S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
+S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
+S3_PRIVATE_BUCKET=
+S3_PUBLIC_BUCKET=
+S3_PUBLIC_URL=
+
+# Admin account (seeded automatically on server start)
+ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@yourdomain.com
+ADMIN_PASSWORD=your_admin_password
+
+# AI provider (development default: openai; production default: off)
+AI_SCREENING_PROVIDER=openai
+OPENAI_API_KEY=your_openai_api_key
+# ALLOW_FOREIGN_AI=true   # required in production to use OpenAI
+
+# Time zone used to decide which sessions are "past" (optional)
+APP_TZ=Asia/Almaty
+
+If S3_* variables are not set, uploads fall back to local disk storage (development only; production refuses to start without S3). If OPENAI_API_KEY is not set, the recommendation engine falls back to built-in baseline content instead of failing.
+
